SECURITY POLICY
===============

Reporting Security Issues
-------------------------
If you discover a security vulnerability, please report it to:
kabeer@otherdev.com or open a issue in this repository.

Do not report security vulnerabilities through public GitHub
issues. Please allow 90 days for a response before public
disclosure.

Security Updates
----------------
- Security updates are released as soon as possible
- Subscribe to our release notifications to stay informed
- Check the releases page regularly for updates

Security Best Practices
-----------------------
For users deploying this software:
- Keep dependencies updated
- Use environment variables for secrets
- Follow secure coding practices
- Regular security audits recommended

